    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>HotBlocks Contact Form includes a simple contact form on your website. The form includes the most used fields: Name, Email, Subject and Message box. The visible anti-spam protection allows you to set a custom question and answer to prevent spam.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Install plugin as usually from WordPress.org. You can also manually download it, unpack and upload the plugin directory to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Add HotBlocks Contact Form to your post/page by clicking on it.</li>\n<li>This block has additional parameters in the Block controls pane.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"what%20to%20do%20with%20plugin%20after%20installation%3F\">\nWhat to do with plugin after installation?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Create or edit a post or page. Click Add Block button, look for HotBlocks Contact Form block and add it on the page.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>The initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Simple contact form block enabled with custom anti-spam protection questions and answers.",
